  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Pack Mentality" id="0f32-d5b5-f8f7-6b5f" hidden="false">
      <description>Space Wolves Packs counts as having one character with the Inspiring special rule when they initiate an assault where they have another formation with the Pack Mentality special rule in support, or when they perform a combined assault where more than one formation in the assault has Pack Mentality. You will never receive more than plus one Inspiring from Pack Mentality, even if you do both a combined assault and have formations in support, or if you have multiple formations in support.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Strategy and Initiative Rating" id="2e13-d8eb-c73e-84d6" hidden="false">
      <comment>space wolves</comment>
      <description>Space Marine armies have a Strategy Rating of 5. All formations have an Initiative Rating of 1+.


The They Shall Know No Fear special rule applies to all Space Wolves Packs and Aircraft formations. Pack Mentality applies to all Core and Elite Packs.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
